mpanies like Microsoft  mcafee into it look at how they got  started I don't care how Bill Gates  makes extra million dollars now but how  do you go from zero to one how do you  make that first million that's what I  wanted to learn and so we copied those  strategies and put them to work for our  business and it was successful so number  one you have to follow your passion  number two you have to model success to  shortcut your pop and number three you  have to not be afraid to take action you  know some things are scary to get  started and you may fall on your face  and you're going to have failures and  that's okay that's part of running the  business you can't be afraid to take  action so I hope that helps that's my  success story I want you to take steps  every day to grow a business don't be  afraid keep doing something every day  even their small steps I'd love to hear  about your six  story if you want to leave it in the  comments below so thank you and I'll see  you soon
 

